{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25820","headline":"新楼诗二十首 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺深松桂无尘事，地接荒郊带夕阳。\n啼鸟歇时山寂寂，野花残处月苍苍。\n绦纱凝焰开金像，清梵销声闭竹房。\n丘壠渐平连茂草，九原何处不心伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}